      537.5211181640625,
      151.90000915527344
    ],
    "text": "This document was created using accessibility techniques for headings, lists, image \nalternate text, tables, and columns. It should be completely accessible using \nassistive technologies such as screen readers."
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      162.50003051757812,
      166.9420166015625,
      180.50003051757812
    ],
    "text": "Headings"
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      191.6999969482422,
      537.4771118164062,
      246.7999725341797
    ],
    "text": "There are eight section headings in this document. At the beginning, \"Sample \nDocument\" is a level 1 heading. The main section headings, such as \"Headings\" and\n\"Lists\" are level 2 headings. The Tables section contains two sub-headings, \"Simple \nTable\" and \"Complex Table,\" which are both level 3 headings."
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      257.3999938964844,
      119.67400360107422,
      275.3999938964844
    ],
    "text": "Lists"
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      286.5,
      535.7171630859375,
      326.9000244140625
    ],
    "text": "The following outline of the sections of this document is an ordered (numbered) list \nwith six items. The fifth item, \"Tables,\" contains a nested unordered (bulleted) list \nwith two items."
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      90.0999984741211,
