      72.0999984741211,
      490.3000183105469,
      530.3931884765625,
      516.0
    ],
    "text": "In web documents, links can point different locations on the page, different pages, \nor even downloadable documents, such as Word documents or PDFs:"
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
