  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      182.39999389648438,
      605.7999877929688,
      539.229248046875,
      646.2000122070312
    ],
    "text": "Documents may contain images. For example, there is an image\nof the web accessibility symbol to the left of this paragraph. Its \nalternate text is \"Web Access Symbol\"."
  },
  {
    "page": 0,
    "bbox": [
      182.39999389648438,
      655.9000244140625,
      532.354248046875,
      681.6000366210938
    ],
    "text": "Alt text should communicate what an image means, not how it \nlooks."
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.0999984741211,
      79.40000915527344,
      537.3511352539062,
      178.6000213623047
    ],
    "text": "Some images, such as charts or graphs, \nrequire long descriptions, but not all \ndocument types allow that. In web pages, \nlong descriptions may be provided in \nseveral ways: on the page below the image,\nvia a link below the image, or via a link on \nthe image."
  },
  {
    "page": 1,
